@startuml kairos-update-profile-settings-sequence
title Update Profile Settings

actor User
participant "Member App" as MemberApp
participant "Kairos API" as API
participant "DB" as DB

User -> MemberApp: Open Profile Settings
MemberApp -> API: GET /profile
API -> DB: SELECT user + member info
DB --> API: profile
API --> MemberApp: 200 OK

User -> MemberApp: Edit details\nClick "Save"
MemberApp -> API: PUT /profile {changes}
API -> DB: UPDATE User/Member
DB --> API: OK
API --> MemberApp: 200 OK

MemberApp --> User: Show "Profile updated"

@enduml
